{
  "job_B9.2.4_20251003_114951": {
    "chunk_text": "on \u00fea snore mid hiere suna, \u00fea hie ongeatan \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t festen sceolde & Cassander hie het \u00fe\u00e6r besittan; & him ealles \u00fe\u00e6s anwaldes weold M\u00e6cedonia rices. \u00dea wende man \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t gewin geendad w\u00e6re betux Alexandres folgerum, \u00fea \u00fea w\u00e6ron gefeallen Ac Antigones, se mid ungemete girnde anwalda ofer o\u00fere, & to \u00fe\u00e6m f\u00e6stenne for \u00fe\u00e6r Si\u00fe\u00fean Cassander \u00fe\u00e6t geascade, \u00fea ge\u00feoftade he wi\u00f0 Ptholomeus, & wi\u00f0 Lisimachus, & wi\u00f0 On \u00fe\u00e6m gefeohte gefeol se m\u00e6sta d\u00e6l Macedonia dugu\u00f0e on \u00e6g\u00feere healfe, \u00feeh hie sume mid \u00de\u00e6r wear\u00f0 Antigones gefliemed & his sunu. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Demetrias, Antigones sunu, gefeaht on scipum wi\u00f0 Ptholomeus, & hiene bedraf on his \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Antigones bebead \u00fe\u00e6t mon \u00e6g\u00f0er hete cyning, ge hiene ge his sunu, for \u00feon \u00fee Gemong \u00fe\u00e6m gewinnum Antigones him ondred Ercoles, Alexandres sunu, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t folc hiene Het \u00fea \u00e6g\u00feer ofslean ge hiene ge his modor. \u00dea \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea o\u00fere geascedon \u00fe\u00e6t he hie ealle beswican \u00feohte, hie \u00fea eft hie gegaderedon, & wi\u00f0 \u00dea ne dorste Cassander self on \u00f0\u00e6m f\u00e6relte cuman, for his \u00f0\u00e6m nihstan feondum \u00fee him ymb Ac sende his fultum to Lisimache his ge\u00feoftan; & h\u00e6fde his wisan swi\u00feost be\u00feoht to Seleucuse, \u00c6fter he gefor on Indie",
